{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "84334",
  "name": "Orka Royal Hotel \u0026 Spa",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "1312346"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Orka Royal Hotel \u0026 Spa, you\u0027ll be centrally located in Istanbul, a 8-minute walk from Egyptian Bazaar and 11 minutes by foot from Hagia Sophia.  This upscale hotel is 0.8 mi (1.3 km) from Grand Bazaar and 0.9 mi (1.5 km) from Topkapi Palace."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 92 air-conditioned rooms featuring minibars and LCD televisions. Your room comes with a Tempur-Pedic bed. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming is available for your entertainment. Bathrooms feature showers with rainfall showerheads and designer toiletries."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Treat yourself with massages, body treatments, and facials. If you\u0027re looking for recreational opportunities, you\u0027ll find a health club, an outdoor pool, and an indoor pool. This Art Deco hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a hair salon.Featured amenities include a business center, express check-in, and express check-out. Event facilities at this hotel consist of a conference center and meeting rooms. A roundtrip airport shuttle is provided for a surcharge (available 24 hours)."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EG\u00FClhane Park - 0.4 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Archaeology Museums - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Eminonu Pier - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Egyptian Bazaar - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bosphorus - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Emin\u00F6n\u00FC Square - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Basilica Cistern - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hagia Sophia - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Topkapi Palace - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sultanahmet Square - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Grand Bazaar - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Cemberlitas Bath - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Turkish and Islamic Art Museum - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E S\u00FCleymaniye Mosque - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Blue Mosque - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EIstanbul Sabiha Gokcen Intl. Airport (SAW) - 47.5 km / 29.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Airport (IST) - 41.3 km / 25.7 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Orka Royal Hotel \u0026 Spa is Istanbul Airport (IST). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": null
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "For lunch or dinner, stop by Eugenius Restaurant, a restaurant that specializes in international cuisine. Dining is also available at the coffee shop/cafe, and 24-hour room service is provided. Relax with a refreshing drink from the bar/lounge or one of the 2 poolside bars."
    }
  ],
